            <lg xml:id="m-70fe20d1-bd19-4b89-8cf9-9711186ce145">
              <l xml:id="m-7528772d-fc70-4139-a0e3-027c36e3137a" facs="#m-98bb8e47-ea37-444f-8219-4a07b00d453d" label="ambiguous">1404</l><l xml:id="m-8ea768e7-b77d-4ae7-a0f2-28f638a982cd" facs="#m-e61fb451-3b55-41c9-ba6b-66b67d1e0cb6" label="ambiguous">March 19.</l><l xml:id="m-ed2226e0-e8c5-4970-9011-c8f7a5fd7a69" facs="#m-c8e37fc1-f19e-409a-8d8f-aa061fc1bfe2" label="lyrics-like">rí- am cón-jugem tú¬ am: quod enim in é- a ná-tum</l><l xml:id="m-dd7d7a8c-8135-42f8-b3d8-59d587fc57e1" facs="#m-9c9cc9da-392b-4276-a150-43f023c2f227" label="lyrics-like">P.T.Alle- lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-de8247b4-1baf-4e52-86d3-25bd8bb71cda" facs="#m-8846e434-b780-45af-84be-73f7da5261be" label="lyrics-like">est, de Spí¬ri-tu Sáncto est.</l><l xml:id="m-48d6a0d4-d33e-4ac5-8945-af5e473305b3" facs="#m-62b4e9d0-3a3b-44cd-af82-0b42a5f3b185" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-92bbf01e-b54d-49d0-9c85-a2d5f33014f8" facs="#m-2757c5bc-f6e4-4015-9de1-d7dde76f2a9f" label="lyrics-like">(Désto nobis, quaésumus miséri-] circa nos propitiátus dona custódi.</l><l xml:id="m-0c471f54-ccf5-40d9-ac5f-29d241e68b72" facs="#m-5e143f61-6038-4c20-970c-75ec40b284d0" label="lyrics-like">I cors Deus: et, intercedénte prol Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c8bd238d-5a2e-449a-826c-7e8a995f56ef" facs="#m-62d9e6df-ad04-429c-9d8c-2124885bc05d" label="lyrics-like">nobis beáto Joseph Confessóre, tua</l><l xml:id="m-e6c925a0-1580-475a-9983-1ad00c56b40a" facs="#m-76eb5533-bbba-4f9e-b33f-ff2a66718788" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-b0502c6e-cb61-42e4-b331-99eb726ea04d" facs="#m-6fbb8ca0-f303-4835-bd08-654f5480e62e" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Non inveniéntes Jésum. D. 1406.</l><l xml:id="m-82513c42-89de-4db6-ac36-c576c2e60501" facs="#m-312e47ad-86e6-4e15-9e08-280d265ca2b1" label="ambiguous">Eccli. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-73e71100-a574-42c9-9503-a4cf589adc87" facs="#m-b8efb937-1e7e-49a6-a5a6-4844edcfdd97" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-3994f262-220d-4976-a643-a17640148857" facs="#m-1835becf-cd7f-46eb-9d23-656cc11feed7" label="lyrics-like">AIléctus Deo et homínibus, cujus! fide et lenitá̂te ipsius sanctum fecit</l><l xml:id="m-f8f2e0df-e58b-478c-b0f7-a08b14dda8d5" facs="#m-c3b0677c-0cf7-49ef-8be0-00e6878c5ba4" label="lyrics-like">I memória in benedictióne est. FIn l illum, * et elégit eum ex omni carne.</l><l xml:id="m-198e1e17-94d4-4224-be14-3223e3831214" facs="#m-d271da07-2542-4580-9c63-c54812362ee4" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-7d267950-d412-4612-8f6e-1bc88a1edfb4" facs="#m-40e8820e-4716-486a-8426-a066e4ff3e92" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-a44651dd-f3aa-4e30-9db2-e0d5a27a7a62" facs="#m-a5b916de-e072-4239-b06a-cb415367bd53" label="lyrics-like">ALAgna est gló-ri-a é-jus " In sa-lu-tá- ri tú¬o</l><l xml:id="m-2292f37f-8270-4e6e-b226-743e9d31d38f" facs="#m-62c27cd5-1821-4aae-a72c-de4b4bdf6fa0" label="lyrics-like">V. Gló-ri-am et mágnum decó-rem impónes super é-um.</l><l xml:id="m-1cc7aeb3-e6a1-47f5-a471-1118c18b1614" facs="#m-b59787c0-cd7e-410c-b595-95d5228d1899" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-b51ab118-5383-4c5d-8d9b-68692a018dfc" facs="#m-694ea27c-ca6a-4420-a95a-07ecb796b761" label="lyrics-like">V. Jústus germinábit sicut lilium.</l><l xml:id="m-9f5b5753-4e42-4aec-b27f-42b8f30ad43b" facs="#m-dbdd8a74-27cf-4b32-b8e3-53079f1fcd1d" label="lyrics-like">K. Et florébit in aetérnum ante Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-9993d917-a15d-4d20-ac63-1e04c6d6d74a" facs="#m-8975ec6d-7615-46ae-ba3f-3ecddab99ee9" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-6d18e251-cf49-4a91-b21c-395a54b96d33" facs="#m-7edd3f21-bd1d-4c3b-8766-81da425016be" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-5c736fee-de04-4234-bc8c-f08fc4262316" facs="#m-f5765ac2-51e4-44ee-bdaa-63e6de09abc5" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-1eb4605b-8106-4092-a129-84b31b51e52c" facs="#m-daef9317-d91f-485e-ad8e-efd485a4e0a5" label="lyrics-like">Agna est gló-ri-a é-jus in sa-lu-tá-ri tú-o:</l><l xml:id="m-c8202e9a-743c-4c97-8c92-7145a7f5a165" facs="#m-a99142d0-fb52-4a13-8c85-8433368b87af" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle lú-ia. V. Gló-ri-am et mágnum decó-rem</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
